OL,3,AClashes seen in some French cities but
OL,4,Aprotests mainly peaceful so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters have clashed with police in
OL,7,Fsome French cities, as tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of people take to the streets
OL,10,FPolice fired tear gas in cities
OL,11,Fincluding Lyon and Marseille, while in
OL,12,FBordeaux, people were seen ripping
OL,13,Fboards from a shop and forming
OL,14,Fbarricades
OL,16,FBut - as our correspondent in Paris
OL,17,Freports - there has not yet been a
OL,18,Frepeat of the chaos seen during
OL,19,Fprevious demonstrations
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
