OL,3,AClashes seen in some French cities but
OL,4,Aprotests mainly peaceful so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance's interior minister earlier said
OL,7,F135 people were arrested across the
OL,8,Fcountry, while police in Paris seized
OL,9,Fweapons and gas masks
OL,11,FToday's marches follow last weekend's
OL,12,Friots and looting that saw more than
OL,13,F2,700 arrested
OL,15,FIn response, curfews, closures and
OL,16,Fprotest bans were put in place -
OL,17,Falthough some demonstrations were
OL,18,Fpermitted. Reminder: Why are people
OL,19,Fprotesting?
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
